    Bug 1991181 - Remove unused nsCharsetConverterManager::GetCharsetTitle. r=jtracey


    "chrome://messenger/locale/charsetTitles.properties" is still being used
    directly by the "menulist-charsetpicker-viewing" custom element.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D266452

